        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          109 Kaganv 'Naa the Chamdaan latho",
            "                           7.7.9.9.Ref. 3. 6. 8.4.4. 8.5",
            "          1. Kaganv naa the chamdaanv tho.",
            "             Suriak thayna bam latho.",
            "             Kandih gwan guay hei nic baic ngam the.",
            "             Lungning hei tancna bam nina cho?",
            "",
            "                Kaganv maek (2) pu-chaih thiu!",
            "                Kandih gwan hei nic baic ngam the,",
            "                Chamdaanv latho, (2)",
            "                Kaganv rau the chamdaanv latho,",
            "                Huayney bam dikho.",
            "",
            "          2. Tingkau baanch'raa 'thanmei nunc.,",
            "             Kaniw' trumpet 'muan khangrui,",
            "             Ntaw hei nic chamdaanv na bam the.",
            "             Kamei guang nimei ganv kiu naa the.",
            "",
            "          3. Ravguangc rui lauziu lev ziuh,",
            "             Kadaa nimei ganv dithe.",
            "             Lauziunac guay tingkauh khou lungc ni,",
            "             Ziuh guay ta mai khou phaiclou pwni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
